  "details": "VRC should add option to disable the avatar stations (seats) in safety (shield) settings, because of a lot of troll avatars that can teleport people to spawn or everywhere in map or do malicious actions like sending them to the space (out of bounds) without ability to leave it. \n\nAnd maybe it will be useful to see in logs whatever station/seat you have used.\n\nPlus actual out of bounds detection should be helpful to teleport player back to the spawn if player is located in area where its basically impossible to open the menu.",
